                    '| 1 | [No Gross Profit Co](#var.vCik=11&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | NGP | 67.0 | 22.3 | 25.0 | 25.0 | -5.0% | no gross profit | 4.0% |  | Stock pay |', \
                    '| 2 | [Stock Pay Co](#var.vCik=1&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | SPAY | 37.6 | 18.6 | 18.1 | 7.4 | -2.0% | 91.7% | 1.2% |  | Stock pay |', \
                    '|  | [Bank Co](#var.vCik=5&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | BANK | n/a | n/a | n/a | n/a | -10.0% | 91.7% | 0.0% |  | Excluded industry |', \
                    '| 3 | [One\\-Off Co](#var.vCik=6&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | OOC | 36.3 | 21.1 | 18.1 | 0.0 | -4.0% | 91.7% | 0.0% | O | Stock pay |', \
                    '| 4 | [Marginal Co](#var.vCik=10&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | MARG | 22.3 | 13.0 | 18.1 | 0.0 | 2.6% | 91.7% | 0.0% |  | Stock pay |', \
                    '|  | [Burner Co](#var.vCik=8&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | BURN | n/a | 25.0 | 18.1 | n/a | -13.0% | 91.7% | n/a | I | Cash burner |', \
                    '|  | [No Cost Line Co](#var.vCik=3&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | NCL | n/a | 24.0 | n/a | n/a | -8.2% | n/a | n/a | N I | Stock pay |', \
                    '|  | [Capital & Sons \\[Holdings\\]](#var.vCik=2&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) |  | n/a | 18.6 | 14.6 | n/a | -2.0% | 87.5% | n/a | I | Capital-led |', \
                    '|  | [Thin Co](#var.vCik=7&var.vPage=\'company\'&_top) | THIN | n/a | 15.4 | 18.1 | n/a | 0.6% | 91.7% | n/a | I | Thin margin |' \
                ] \
