                '', \
                'From fiscal 2019 to 2025, Stock Pay Co reported $10.2 billion of revenue and $1.0 billion of free cash flow. Stock pay was $1.2 billion, which leaves -$203 million of owner cash: -2.0% of revenue. Owner cash was under 3.0% of revenue in 7 of 7 years. In the 12 months to 2026-09-30 it was -2.0% of revenue.' \
            ] \
