                    '| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |', \
                    '| Owner cash as the company grows | Appears | Stays near zero | Under 3.0% of revenue in 0 of 7 years; above it in the latest fiscal year. 8.0% in the latest 12 months. |', \
                    '| Operating costs | Leave part of gross profit | Take all of gross profit | Took 66.7% of gross profit in 2025. Against revenue: 55.0% in 2021, 40.0% in 2025 |', \
