            [ \
                '', \
                'From the SEC insider filings (Forms 4 and 5) of officers and directors. Cash taken out is open-market sales, plus shares', \
                'withheld for taxes or sold to the company, less open-market purchases and what was paid to exercise options, each at the', \
                'price reported. Shares withheld count', \
                'because some companies have insiders sell on the market to cover the same taxes. Grants are reported, not scored: a stock', \
                'award is valued at the nearest share price insiders reported, and an option at its exercise price, which overstates it.', \
                'Shares held through an outside director\'s investment fund are left out. Amended filings are not used.' \
            ] \
