                    '', \
                    '## Insiders Beside Owners, 2021‑2025', \
                    '', \
                    'What the officers and directors of these companies took out through stock over five calendar years, beside the owner', \
                    'cash the same companies produced. The last column is the baseline: the companies that pass the basic tests and do', \
